  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ljtn/epiq/zipball/v1.14.0",
  "body": "v1.14.0\r\n\r\nBoard and lane descriptions\r\n- Board and lane descriptions hold conventions agents follow; the MCP\r\n  hands them out on assume, get, create and move (requested by @cmoncure)\r\n\r\nBoard and lane panels\r\n- Lane and board panels hold their description; a board's opens from\r\n  its row in the switcher\r\n- Board stats: flow over 8 weeks and time per lane, with checkbox\r\n  legends on every breakdown\r\n\r\nCommits\r\n- Link a commit by an Epiq-Ref: line in its body (by @mikepurvis)\r\n- Commit messages show in the commit panel and Code tab\r\n\r\nEditing\r\n- Unsent ticket text survives tab switches; ask before leaving (requested by @aclemmensen)\r\n- Descriptions keep line breaks, and the editor grows with its text\r\n\r\nGUI\r\n- Styling, cleanup\r\n\r\nPerformance\r\n- Board reads stay fast at 10-year size\r\n\r\nSpecial thanks to\r\n- @mikepurvis for Epiq-Ref commit linking (#468)\r\n- @cmoncure for the idea of board rules for agents (#469)\r\n- @aclemmensen for keeping unsent text (#475)",
  "mentions_count": 3
